# FinFlow — Finance Dashboard

A production-quality, fintech-grade Finance Dashboard built with React, Tailwind CSS, Recharts, and Zustand.

---

## Features

- **Dashboard Overview** — Summary cards (balance, income, expenses), 6-month area trend chart, interactive category pie chart, recent transactions feed
- **Transactions Page** — Full table with search, category/type filters, sortable columns (date, amount), hover-reveal admin actions
- **Insights Page** — Month-over-month comparison, smart AI-style text insights, category bar chart comparison, top spending category
- **Role-Based UI** — Toggle between `Admin` (add/edit/delete transactions) and `Viewer` (read-only) modes
- **Add/Edit Modal** — Validated form with income/expense toggle, category picker, clean UX
- **Dark Mode** — Full dark/light theme toggle with smooth transition, persisted to localStorage
- **Data Persistence** — Zustand + localStorage keeps transactions and theme across sessions
- **Responsive** — Mobile, tablet, desktop layouts; collapsible sidebar

