## Design Decisions

- **Syne** (display) + **JetBrains Mono** (numbers) — distinctive typographic pairing that reads "fintech" without being generic
- **Slate base palette** with `brand-600` (`#0284c7`) accents — professional, not flashy
- **Card system** — `card` utility class keeps all surfaces consistent across light/dark
- **Zustand with `persist`** — minimal boilerplate, localStorage sync out of the box
- **Role-based rendering** — admin actions (edit/delete buttons, Add button) are hidden from Viewer; no routing changes needed
- **Empty state handling** — every list/table has a styled empty state
- **Animation strategy** — `animate-slide-up` with staggered delays creates perceived performance without heavy libraries

